--TEST--
`prepareRename` in the HTML after a closing `?>` is refused, because template text holds no symbol, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
var $name = "world";
?>
<p>hel<|>lo</p>
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
